@startuml F5.3-D02-nova-interna
title F5.3-D02 — Nova interna em nome de aluno
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Buscar aluno (GRR/nome)
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /alunos?q=
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT no escopo
Postgres --> WebApp: candidatos
Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar wizard
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests\n{ onBehalfOf }
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT request\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Sec: na fila

@enduml
